{
  "name": "some_every_key_value",
  "note": "`some k, v in xs` and `every k, v in xs` bind the key as well as the value: an array's index, an object's key. Both must come from the same element, so an owner at index 1 is not an owner at index 0, and a tenant matching one grant's key does not borrow another grant's value. An array's key is a number, so a string tenant never matches an index. `every` over an empty object holds; over a missing or non-object source it does not, and a list source binds indexes, never the string \"secret\". A set is keyed by its members, so `k == v` holds for each. `every i, x` over an array binds the index, so a third element fails `i < 2` whatever it holds.",
  "rego": "package authz\n\nimport rego.v1\n\ndefault allow := false\n\nallow if {\n\tsome i, u in input.users\n\ti == 0\n\tu.role == \"owner\"\n}\n\nallow if {\n\tsome k, v in input.grants\n\tk == input.tenant\n\tv == \"write\"\n}\n\nallow if {\n\tinput.mode == \"audit\"\n\tevery k, v in input.labels {\n\t\tk != \"secret\"\n\t\tv != \"\"\n\t}\n}\n\nallow if {\n\tinput.mode == \"set\"\n\tsome k, v in {\"a\", \"b\"}\n\tk == v\n\tk == input.want\n}\n\nallow if {\n\tinput.mode == \"index\"\n\tevery i, x in input.xs {\n\t\ti < 2\n\t\tx != \"stop\"\n\t}\n}\n",
  "cases": [
    {
      "input": {
        "users": [
          {
            "role": "owner"
          },
          {
            "role": "dev"
          }
        ]
      },
      "expected": 1
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "users": [
          {
            "role": "dev"
          },
          {
            "role": "owner"
          }
        ]
      },
      "expected": 0
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "users": {
          "0": {
            "role": "owner"
          }
        }
      },
      "expected": 0
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "tenant": "acme",
        "grants": {
          "acme": "write",
          "other": "read"
        }
      },
      "expected": 1
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "tenant": "acme",
        "grants": {
          "acme": "read",
          "other": "write"
        }
      },
      "expected": 0
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "tenant": "write",
        "grants": {
          "acme": "write"
        }
      },
      "expected": 0
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "tenant": "acme",
        "grants": [
          "write"
        ]
      },
      "expected": 0
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "tenant": 0,
        "grants": [
          "write"
        ]
      },
      "expected": 1
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "mode": "audit",
        "labels": {
          "team": "x",
          "env": "prod"
        }
      },
      "expected": 1
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "mode": "audit",
        "labels": {
          "team": "x",
          "secret": "y"
        }
      },
      "expected": 0
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "mode": "audit",
        "labels": {
          "team": ""
        }
      },
      "expected": 0
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "mode": "audit",
        "labels": {}
      },
      "expected": 1
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "mode": "audit"
      },
      "expected": 0
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "mode": "audit",
        "labels": [
          "secret"
        ]
      },
      "expected": 1
    },
    {
      "input": {},
      "expected": 0
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "mode": "set",
        "want": "a"
      },
      "expected": 1
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "mode": "set",
        "want": "c"
      },
      "expected": 0
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "mode": "index",
        "xs": [
          "a",
          "b"
        ]
      },
      "expected": 1
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "mode": "index",
        "xs": [
          "a",
          "b",
          "c"
        ]
      },
      "expected": 0
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "mode": "index",
        "xs": [
          "stop"
        ]
      },
      "expected": 0
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "mode": "index",
        "xs": []
      },
      "expected": 1
    }
  ]
}
